# Two-part sub-mesh demo asset: a wooden post + a metal sign board, one usemtl group
# each. Deliberately has no vn/vt data at all so loading this exercises Mesh::ParseObjFileGroups'
# per-group flat-normal-generation path, not just the "vn present" path.
usemtl wood
v -0.15 0.0 -0.15
v  0.15 0.0 -0.15
v  0.15 0.0  0.15
v -0.15 0.0  0.15
v -0.15 2.0 -0.15
v  0.15 2.0 -0.15
v  0.15 2.0  0.15
v -0.15 2.0  0.15
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 8 7 6
f 4 3 7 8
f 2 1 5 6
f 3 2 6 7
f 1 4 8 5
usemtl metal
v -0.5 2.0 -0.05
v  0.5 2.0 -0.05
v  0.5 2.0  0.05
v -0.5 2.0  0.05
v -0.5 2.6 -0.05
v  0.5 2.6 -0.05
v  0.5 2.6  0.05
v -0.5 2.6  0.05
f 9 10 11 12
f 13 16 15 14
f 12 11 15 16
f 10 9 13 14
f 11 10 14 15
f 9 12 16 13
